{"id":"b321fe579fa583cd","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-bounded-quantifier.md","title":"Bounded and Sharply Bounded Quantifiers","display":"df-bounded-quantifier — Bounded and Sharply Bounded Quantifiers","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-bounded-quantifier","aliases":["72-df-bounded-quantifier"],"display":"df-bounded-quantifier — Bounded and Sharply Bounded Quantifiers","depends_on":["[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]]"],"source_author":"Samuel R. Buss","source_chapter":"Samuel R. Buss, Chapter II, Proof Theory of Arithmetic, in Handbook of Proof Theory (1998)","source_sections":"§1","source_printed_pages":"82","source_pdf_pages":"94","source_pdf":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)\\[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"round2_verification_status":"definition-contract-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-bounded-quantifier"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-bounded-quantifier</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bounded-quantifier — Bounded and Sharply Bounded Quantifiers"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5635e2f9f2823a2f\" href=\"?note=5635e2f9f2823a2f\" title=\"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language\">72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_author","html":"Samuel R. Buss"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"Samuel R. Buss, Chapter II, Proof Theory of Arithmetic, in Handbook of Proof Theory (1998)"},{"key":"source_sections","html":"§1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"82"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"94"},{"key":"source_pdf","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A},\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\}\">\\(L\\in\\{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A},\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\}\\)</span>，语法与变量支持取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5635e2f9f2823a2f\" href=\"?note=5635e2f9f2823a2f\" title=\"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language\">72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(L)\">\\(t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_L(t)\">\\(x\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_L(t)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\)</span>。以下是元语言语法缩写，不是新增对象语言量词。</li>\n<li>锐有界的两式仅取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}\">\\(L=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\exists x\\leq t)\\varphi:=\\exists x\\,(x\\leq t\\land\\varphi),\\qquad\n(\\forall x\\leq t)\\varphi:=\\forall x\\,(x\\leq t\\to\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\exists x\\leq t)\\varphi:=\\exists x\\,(x\\leq t\\land\\varphi),\\qquad\n(\\forall x\\leq t)\\varphi:=\\forall x\\,(x\\leq t\\to\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\exists x\\leq|t|)\\varphi:=\\exists x\\,(x\\leq|t|\\land\\varphi),\\qquad\n(\\forall x\\leq|t|)\\varphi:=\\forall x\\,(x\\leq|t|\\to\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\exists x\\leq|t|)\\varphi:=\\exists x\\,(x\\leq|t|\\land\\varphi),\\qquad\n(\\forall x\\leq|t|)\\varphi:=\\forall x\\,(x\\leq|t|\\to\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ch. II 印刷 p. 82（PDF p. 94）明确要求界项不含被约束变量。此前缺失的条件已成为正式输入条件。</li>\n<li>语法类别按这些缩写的指定构造理解；不把展开后出现的普通一阶量词误计为非有界量词。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"5635e2f9f2823a2f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"5635e2f9f2823a2f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A},\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\}$，语法与变量支持取 [[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L\\in\\{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A},\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(L)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_L(t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)","display":false},{"tex":"L=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}","display":false},{"tex":"(\\exists x\\leq t)\\varphi:=\\exists x\\,(x\\leq t\\land\\varphi),\\qquad\n(\\forall x\\leq t)\\varphi:=\\forall x\\,(x\\leq t\\to\\varphi).","display":true},{"tex":"(\\exists x\\leq|t|)\\varphi:=\\exists x\\,(x\\leq|t|\\land\\varphi),\\qquad\n(\\forall x\\leq|t|)\\varphi:=\\forall x\\,(x\\leq|t|\\to\\varphi).","display":true}],"bytes":1974,"backlinks":[{"id":"fb2b2dbad774692a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$x,t$ 在每一量词构造中均满足 $x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S$、$t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(L)$ 与 $x\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_L(t)$（见 [[72-df-bounded-quantifier]]）。"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-203","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-bounded-quantifier|df-bounded-quantifier — Bounded and Sharply Bounded Quantifiers]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-201","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df-bounded-quantifier — Bounded and Sharply Bounded Quantifiers](72-df-bounded-quantifier.md)"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-217","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-bounded-quantifier|df-bounded-quantifier — Bounded and Sharply Bounded Quantifiers]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-45","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-bounded-quantifier]]"}],"outgoing":["5635e2f9f2823a2f"]}